    "boundary_sensitivity": "Do not require unprovided body text, missing chapters, personal data or unvalidated personal parameters; correct explicit limitation can pass.",
    "privacy": "Public reporting must contain no source prose, private paths or health data; use original assessment summaries, case identifiers, counts and hashes only."
